Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:36.92,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.29,0:00:03.58,Title,0,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》前情回顾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Previously on AMC's The Walking Dead…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.70,0:00:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 加百利 - 你说你有个教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 加百利… - You said you had a church.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.55,0:00:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信这家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust this guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.51,0:00:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有所隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's hiding something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.71,0:00:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个储粮库 粮济全郡\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was the food bank. Served the whole county.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.99,0:00:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们去救加百利 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have to get Gabriel. - What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.66,0:00:14.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.01,0:00:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要带尤金去华盛顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We get Eugene to Washington,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.89,0:00:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他可以了结这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he will make the dead die.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.95,0:00:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类将重获世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the living will have this world again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.96,0:00:22.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也去！就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in! Let's do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.03,0:00:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,好消息是 你还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good news is, you're not dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.16,0:00:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,但一日将过\N{\fnArial\fs30}But at the end of the day,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.61,0:00:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,人总得进食啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}a man's got to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.65,0:00:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许在这儿待着很蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's probably pretty stupid to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.40,0:00:51.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,危机四伏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.74,0:00:53.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 也许不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.80,0:00:59.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能看到威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can see the threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.85,0:01:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.44,0:01:05.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着它们会让我觉得好受点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking at them makes me feel better about things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.48,0:01:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我母亲常说\N{\fnArial\fs30}My mom used to say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.31,0:01:09.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,活一天就胜一场\N{\fnArial\fs30}every day above ground was a win.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.15,0:01:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,太他妈有道理了 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doesn't really apply anymore, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:14.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还可以看长远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can still get some perspective.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.37,0:01:24.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,这玻璃早晚会碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}The glass is gonna break sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.83,0:01:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么会永垂不朽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing lasts too long anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.38,0:01:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一路做标记\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we marked our way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.50,0:01:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以就能找到回去的路\N{\fnArial\fs30}so that we could find our way back after.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,太二了 是吧？我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}So stupid, right? I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.89,0:01:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,回哪儿？\N{\fnArial\fs30}back to what?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.44,0:01:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不仅是个陷阱\N{\fnArial\fs30}It wasn't just a trap.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.34,0:01:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是一次选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was gonna be a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.61,0:02:00.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,加入我们 或被我们吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}You join us or feed us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.87,0:02:04.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.37,0:02:06.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,熊这种生物…\N{\fnArial\fs30}bears…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.67,0:02:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是挨饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}when they start to starve,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.66,0:02:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会食子\N{\fnArial\fs30}they eat their young.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.79,0:02:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是大熊死了 幼崽还是死\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the bear dies, the cub dies anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.96,0:02:16.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果大熊活下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if the bear lives,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.10,0:02:18.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,还能再生幼崽\N{\fnArial\fs30}it can always have another cub.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.89,0:02:24.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,说跑偏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was part of the pitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.69,0:02:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 格雷格和迈克过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Greg and Mike came this close.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.81,0:02:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是为了抓那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}to nabbing that grey-haired queen bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.22,0:02:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀了我母亲的白发婊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}who killed my mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.56,0:02:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她和弩哥开车走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She drove away with the archer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.90,0:02:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,格雷格看到他们扬尘而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greg saw them pull away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.65,0:02:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,等不及想尝尝她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't wait to try her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.62,0:02:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更喜欢女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like women better.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.57,0:02:46.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大多都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of us do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.41,0:02:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弟弟亚里克斯曾…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother Alex has…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.83,0:02:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为瑞克 他现在也不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}also currently dead because of Rick…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.05,0:02:56.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,他曾说过这个理论\N{\fnArial\fs30}he had a theory that it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.16,0:02:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,女人因为生育\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of the extra layer of fat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.42,0:03:00.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,皮下脂肪多一层 你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}that women have, you know, for childbearing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.72,0:03:02.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是骨感美女也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even the skinny girls have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.68,0:03:08.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,像漂亮的…萨沙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that pretty one… Sasha?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.93,0:03:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得好看的也会更好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think pretty people taste better, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.00,0:03:24.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会抓住他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're going to get all of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但对于初学者 你很不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for starters, you'll do just fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:29.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你腿就贡献良多\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did a good job on your leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.70,0:03:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们慢慢练\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've had practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.84,0:03:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦学起来 就得放慢进程了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When we started, it was about making it slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.21,0:03:41.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是个人啊 在和你说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm being a human being here. I'm talking to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.68,0:03:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,看清形势 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perspective, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.63,0:03:46.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还在地上坐着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're above ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:48.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少比他们强多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least you're better off than them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.87,0:04:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 他疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.70,0:04:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我想象的疯得晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lasted longer than I thought he would.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.24,0:04:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.08,0:04:12.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,一群大傻逼\N{\fnArial\fs30}you idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.66,0:04:14.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, keep it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.72,0:04:18.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以让他闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can shut him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.06,0:04:24.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被咬了 你们这帮傻叉！\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been bitten, you stupid pricks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.34,0:04:27.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm tainted meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.24,0:04:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 让我宰了他 - 不 我们需要他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let's just kill him now. - No, no, we need him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.44,0:04:41.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可吃了丧尸肉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We might as well be eating one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.91,0:04:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会发生什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell's gonna happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.24,0:04:44.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,会转化吗？ 会死吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we gonna turn? Are we just gonna die?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.69,0:04:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿尔伯特 他妈冷静 我们烹饪过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Albert, calm the hell down. We cooked him.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.75,0:04:48.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything is gonna be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈为什么不先检查下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why the hell didn't you check him first?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.12,0:04:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause he was fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.87,0:04:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 感染肉啊！ - 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tainted meat! - Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.00,0:04:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们吃了丧尸肉！ - 我说了闭嘴！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You eating tainted meat! - I said shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.86,0:06:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.17,0:06:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tyreese.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.03,0:06:25.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他走了 - 谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's getting away. - Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.25,0:06:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在监视我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody was watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.29,0:06:29.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果现在进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we go in there now,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.46,0:06:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计就有人出不来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}some of us aren't coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.26,0:06:33.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃就在外面什么地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob is out there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.04,0:06:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,害怕 孤独\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scared, alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.63,0:06:37.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许不是独自一人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.22,0:06:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔和卡罗尔也不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl and Carol are missing, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.21,0:07:03.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.21,0:07:07.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.33,0:07:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.84,0:07:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就对上号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is all connected.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.81,0:07:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}You show up,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.23,0:07:23.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就被监视了\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're being watched,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.59,0:07:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在我们有三个人都不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and now three of us are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.02,0:07:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.85,0:07:32.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.19,0:07:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟这事没一点关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have anything to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.27,0:07:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 等等！ - 别！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait! - Don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.66,0:07:41.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 萨沙 收起来 - 谁在外面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sasha, put it away. - Who's out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.03,0:07:42.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我 我跟这…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… I don't have anything…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.86,0:07:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有一点关系 - 我们的人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- to do with this. - Where are our people?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.25,0:07:47.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟这事没 - 我们的人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't have anything to… - Where are our people?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.37,0:07:49.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 我跟这事没一点关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I don't have anything to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.09,0:07:50.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.88,0:07:57.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么把我们带到这？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why'd you bring us here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.55,0:08:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, I…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.55,0:08:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟谁一起工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You working with someone?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.14,0:08:06.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一个人 我自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm alone. I'm alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.19,0:08:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was always alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.69,0:08:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个储粮库的女人呢 Gabriel？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the woman in the food bank, Gabriel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.61,0:08:11.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对她做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.94,0:08:14.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,“你会被这一切焚尽”\N{\fnArial\fs30}"You'll burn for this."
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.36,0:08:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你写的吧 为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was for you. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.61,0:08:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了什么被焚啊 Gabriel？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna burn for, Gabriel?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.73,0:08:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,说？ 你做了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.70,0:08:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你过去做了什么？！\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did you do?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.41,0:08:31.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我晚上把门关上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lock the doors at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.13,0:08:32.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常晚上把门关上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always lock the doors at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.63,0:08:34.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常晚上把门关上的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always lock the doors at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.58,0:08:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.67,0:08:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们陆续过来 我的子民们\N{\fnArial\fs30}They started coming, my congregation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.93,0:08:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,之前亚特兰大在晚上被轰炸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Atlanta was bombed the night before.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.63,0:08:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们害怕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they were scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.43,0:08:51.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们…他们在寻找一个安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were… they were looking for a safe place,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.93,0:08:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个他们觉得安全的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}a place where they felt safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.44,0:09:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那会儿还早 很早\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it was so early. It was so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.36,0:09:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以门还关着\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the doors were still locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.28,0:09:09.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.25,0:09:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}it was my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.67,0:09:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们人太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were so many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.26,0:09:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们试图撬开百叶窗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they were trying to pry the shutters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.80,0:09:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,使劲撞击侧面 冲我叫唤\N{\fnArial\fs30}and banging on the sidings, screaming at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.71,0:09:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以那些行尸就向他们去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so the dead came for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.47,0:09:30.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,妇人…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Women…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.64,0:09:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}children.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.40,0:09:44.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有人痛苦的喊着我的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Entire families calling my name as they were torn apart,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.65,0:09:46.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求我的怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}begging me for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.49,0:09:48.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求我的怜悯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begging me for mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.32,0:09:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该下地狱啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damning me to hell.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.67,0:10:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我焚烧了他们的尸骨\N{\fnArial\fs30}I buried their bones.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.59,0:10:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,都烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I buried it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.88,0:10:12.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,主最终还是让你来惩罚我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lord sent you here to finally punish me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.11,0:10:23.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm damned.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.49,0:10:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was damned before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.53,0:10:30.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我经常锁着门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always lock the doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.41,0:10:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,锁着门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I always lock the doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.88,0:10:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,那儿有…\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.21,0:10:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,玻璃外有人躲着\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's someone outside lying in the grass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.30,0:10:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,萨沙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.43,0:10:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Bob!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.55,0:10:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.31,0:10:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他的腿 - 把Bob带进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- His leg. - Get Bob inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.21,0:10:59.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会照顾好他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take care of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.31,0:11:01.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能帮帮我吗 求你了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you help me, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.99,0:11:02.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,帮帮我 帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me. Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.40,0:11:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,进去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.54,0:11:12.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.43,0:11:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我之前在墓地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was in the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.42,0:11:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人把我打晕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody knocked me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.15,0:11:29.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚醒来就在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I woke up outside this place.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.79,0:11:33.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,那看起来像个学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}It looked like a school.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.06,0:11:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,是那个人 加雷斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was that guy, Gareth.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.43,0:11:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有其他5个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And five other ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.83,0:11:43.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在我面前吃我的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were eating my leg right in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.94,0:11:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像这没什么一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.87,0:11:50.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像无比自豪的了结了一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}All proud like they had it all figured out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.08,0:11:54.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,她们抓了达里尔和卡罗尔吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did they have Daryl and Carol?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:11:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,加雷斯说他们开车走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gareth said they drove off.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很痛 有什么能用的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in pain. Do we have anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.09,0:12:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得急救箱里应该有药品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there are pill packets in the first aid kit.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.43,0:12:10.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 恩 - 留着吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Save 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.51,0:12:12.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 说真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.12,0:12:37.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在储粮库时被咬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happened at the food bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.13,0:12:42.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.17,0:12:53.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.91,0:12:58.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我办公室里有个沙发\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a sofa in my office.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.45,0:13:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这不算什么 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it's not much, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.53,0:13:06.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.24,0:13:09.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.29,0:13:15.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道鲍勃说的那个地方吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know the place Bob was talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.54,0:13:17.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个小学\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.88,0:13:19.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 离这儿很近 - 多近？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's close. - How close?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.88,0:13:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,多近啊 加百利？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How close, Gabriel?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.67,0:13:31.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这走十分钟 穿过树林就到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just a 10-minute walk through the woods from here,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.06,0:13:33.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,在墓地的正南方\N{\fnArial\fs30}due south of the graveyard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.76,0:13:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shh, shh, shh.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.57,0:13:41.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是发烧了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does he have a fever?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.57,0:13:43.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是有点热\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just warm.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.44,0:13:45.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,吉姆大概活了两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jim lasted almost two days.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.64,0:13:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,之后我们就丢下他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we left him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.08,0:13:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,该面对现实了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Time for a reality check.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.28,0:13:53.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在全部都要去特区\N{\fnArial\fs30}We all need to leave for DC right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.70,0:13:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,达里尔和卡罗尔会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl and Carol are gonna be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.20,0:14:00.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有他们我们哪儿都不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going anywhere without them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.26,0:14:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赞赏你的态度\N{\fnArial\fs30}I respect that,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.25,0:14:02.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但明显现在尤金有危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}but there's a clear threat here to Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:05.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得保护好他 防止事态恶化\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to extract his ass before things get any uglier.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.34,0:14:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们不愿意来 祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if y'all won't come, good luck to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.13,0:14:09.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们做你们的 我做我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go our separate ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.43,0:14:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就打算步行吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You leaving on foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.88,0:14:16.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把那辆车修好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We fixed that damn bus ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.56,0:14:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这儿的人还有那么多\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are a lot more of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.22,0:14:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就想一直这样吗？你来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to keep it that way? You should come.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.56,0:14:24.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗尔救了你的命 我们救了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol saved your life. We saved your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.61,0:14:27.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我是在救你们大家命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am trying to save yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.07,0:14:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,救每个人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save everyone's.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.90,0:14:31.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是不会分头行动的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not going anywhere without our people.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你们的人都逃了 - 他们会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your people took off. - They're coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.46,0:14:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,回来干啥？来看你们剩下的骨头吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what, picked-over bones?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.21,0:14:36.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你还没明白 - 别碰我！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're not taking - Do not lay hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.99,0:14:40.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亚伯拉罕！- 喂 打住！打住！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Abraham! - Hey, hey, stop! Now!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的觉得 你大半夜的这样离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you really think that you're gonna be any safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.05,0:14:48.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就会更安全吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaving right now in the middle of the night?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.19,0:14:49.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.29,0:14:52.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.81,0:14:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,那明天呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.93,0:14:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要团结才能做到\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need each other for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.26,0:14:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,要团结才能到达特区\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need each other to get to DC.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.90,0:15:02.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们团结就可以渡过这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can get through all of it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.24,0:15:06.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.19,0:15:11.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你多待一天帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you stay just one more day and help,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.86,0:15:14.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你们去特区 不论发生什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go with you to DC no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.62,0:15:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.12,0:15:25.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,格伦和玛姬也来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glenn and Maggie, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.29,0:15:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不行 - 那祝你们好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Good luck, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.71,0:15:31.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我对你们的人也不感兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not interested in breaking up what you have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.96,0:15:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔 抄起你的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita, grab your gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.05,0:15:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 亚伯拉罕 - 少废话！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Abraham - Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.43,0:15:39.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤金 我们走 尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene, let's go. Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.14,0:15:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.19,0:15:45.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不想 - 快起来！\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't want to. - Now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.89,0:15:47.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.82,0:16:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能用那辆公车\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not taking the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.00,0:16:08.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,试着拦下我啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.84,0:16:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,慢着 慢着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, wait, wait, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.76,0:16:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.35,0:16:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.02,0:16:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下来帮助我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}you stay and help us,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.24,0:16:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我们就跟你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we will go with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.41,0:16:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 这不是你说了算\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - It's not your call.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.20,0:16:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,你留下来帮我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay, help us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.09,0:16:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,就半天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Half a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,正午走 时间紧迫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come high noon, we're taillights.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.80,0:16:58.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会再多等了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not waiting for the other damn shoe to drop.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.18,0:17:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会和你走的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will leave with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.73,0:17:08.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,12个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}12 hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.73,0:17:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.66,0:17:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,其实 我脸上被打\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the one good thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.75,0:17:30.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}about getting kicked in my face…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.67,0:17:35.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是让我忘了腿上的疼痛\N{\fnArial\fs30}made me forget the pain in my leg.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.17,0:17:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有我半身的疼痛 所以是两个好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my side, so two good things.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.68,0:17:45.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再说傻话了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not playing that game anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.60,0:17:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,恩…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:53.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,从各面考虑\N{\fnArial\fs30}all things considered,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.94,0:17:57.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你可以逗我笑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}figured you could humor me a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.17,0:18:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,被咬后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't you tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.20,0:18:10.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不告诉我？\N{\fnArial\fs30}when it happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.21,0:18:13.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.91,0:18:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉你的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}when I told you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.20,0:18:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,就会像一切都结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it'd become all about the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.08,0:18:27.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,而我很享受这个过程\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I really liked the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.20,0:18:49.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们以为他们掌控了局面\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think they're in control.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.61,0:18:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在明 他们在暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're in here and they could be anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.46,0:18:55.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们知道他们的确切位置\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we know exactly where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.69,0:19:01.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,计划受阻 我只能这么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plan's got stones, I'll give you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.72,0:19:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们得赶在他们前面　- 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Make our move before they do. - That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.97,0:19:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不指望我们头脑清晰\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not counting on us thinking straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.22,0:19:10.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.36,0:19:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只想确认一下　这可不是件小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just making sure. It's a big play.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.23,0:19:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,时刻记得提防这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember what these people are capable of.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.91,0:19:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 泰尔西 - 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Tyreese. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.08,0:19:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You up for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:34.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和你们一起去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.13,0:19:37.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该和鲍勃呆一块儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should stay with Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.14,0:19:39.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不　我想出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I want to be out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.89,0:19:42.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想参与进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to be a part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这是什么感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.11,0:20:04.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}But this right here,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.36,0:20:07.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以和他在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}the time you could have with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.22,0:20:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能错过这个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't throw that away.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.99,0:20:14.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望我和凯伦有这样的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I had it with Karen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.23,0:20:24.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得当时的感受吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember how you felt?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.27,0:20:29.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有你当时想做的事？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you wanted to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.71,0:20:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.21,0:20:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那让我迷茫\N{\fnArial\fs30}It made it so I couldn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.75,0:20:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,饶恕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgiveness.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.18,0:20:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,勇敢面对\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's facing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.82,0:20:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我应该饶恕他们吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should forgive them?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.93,0:20:53.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算伤害他 想要杀了我们？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For hurting him? For trying to kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.50,0:20:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.17,0:20:59.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得我们还有选择吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think we have a choice?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.37,0:21:01.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是所有的人都能选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not all of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.80,0:21:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有你有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.24,0:21:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他睁开眼\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he opens his eyes,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.81,0:21:09.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,唯一想看到的就是你的脸\N{\fnArial\fs30}the only thing he's gonna want to see is your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.57,0:21:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.44,0:21:28.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果他停止呼吸…　　- Sasha\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If he stops breathing… - Sasha.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.36,0:21:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,…你把这个穿过他的太阳穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}…you put it through his temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.34,0:21:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是鲍勃想要的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what Bob would want.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.02,0:24:04.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想你知道我们在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I guess you know we're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.86,0:24:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们也知道你们在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we know you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.70,0:24:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且我们武器齐全\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're armed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.54,0:24:23.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有没必要躲躲藏藏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there's really no point in hiding anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.13,0:24:37.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直在监视你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've been watching you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.11,0:24:43.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们知道都有谁在\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know who's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.81,0:24:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃在\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's Bob,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.73,0:24:52.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你们还没结束他的痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you've put him out of his misery already.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.29,0:24:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有尤金\N{\fnArial\fs30}And Eugene.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.16,0:25:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,罗西塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rosita.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.38,0:25:03.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁的好朋友泰尔西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin's good friend Tyreese.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.42,0:25:08.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.92,0:25:15.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,朱迪斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Judith.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.64,0:25:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克和其他人出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick and the rest walked out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.81,0:25:24.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,拿着你们大部分枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}with a lot of your guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.19,0:25:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着　我们不知道你们在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we don't know where you all are,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.99,0:25:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是这个地方不大\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this isn't a big place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.83,0:25:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在别闹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So let's just stop this now.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.62,0:25:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别把事情搞得更糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}before things get more painful than they need to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.53,0:26:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着　你们就躲在某一扇门后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, you're behind one of these two doors.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.48,0:26:15.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们手上武器干掉你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we have more than enough firepower.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.04,0:26:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是绰绰有余\N{\fnArial\fs30}to take down both.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.82,0:26:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这应该不是你们想要的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't imagine that's what you all want.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.74,0:26:26.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个神父怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about the priest?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.13,0:26:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,神父　你帮我们把事办好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father, you help us wrap this up,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.80,0:26:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就让你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll let you walk away from this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.58,0:26:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要把门打开　你就可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just open the door and you can go.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.15,0:26:45.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以把小婴儿带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can take the baby with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.15,0:26:49.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.37,0:27:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许我们可以留下这个孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. Maybe we'll keep the kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.70,0:27:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我越来越喜欢这小女孩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm starting to like this girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.95,0:27:14.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你最后的机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's your last chance right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.08,0:27:14.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}to tell us you're coming out.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.96,0:27:21.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,完了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we done?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.96,0:27:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放在地板上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your guns on the floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.13,0:27:35.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克　我们直接朝那间办公室开枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick, we'll fire right into that office.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.78,0:27:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把枪拿低点\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you lower your gun…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.34,0:27:39.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.85,0:27:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,把枪放地上　跪下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put your guns on the floor and kneel.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.68,0:27:54.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,照他说的做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.16,0:28:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,马丁　我们没有其他选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Martin, there's no choice here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.66,0:28:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不　我们还有选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.67,0:28:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,想打个赌吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to bet?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.40,0:28:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,求饶也没有意义了　对吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}No point in begging, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.04,0:28:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.16,0:28:51.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你进来的时候　有机会杀掉我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, you could have killed us when you came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.96,0:28:53.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}There had to be a reason for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.16,0:28:57.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不想浪费子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't want to waste the bullets.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.27,0:29:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以前帮过人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We used to help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.17,0:29:06.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们拯救别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saved people.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.59,0:29:12.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在变了　他们来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things changed. They came in and…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.27,0:29:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After that…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.70,0:29:31.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你在外面呆过　但我也知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know that you've been out there, but I can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.53,0:29:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不知道饥肠辘辘是何感受\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what it is to be hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.93,0:29:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不必这样做\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't have to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.43,0:29:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们可以走得远远的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can walk away.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.10,0:29:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们永无交集\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we will never cross paths again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.05,0:29:48.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.30,0:29:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你会遇上其他的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you'll cross someone's path.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.14,0:30:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,会对其他人做同样的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd do this to anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.03,0:30:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}right?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.36,0:30:04.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.62,0:30:08.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经给过你承诺了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already made you a promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.07,0:30:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不！\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.19,0:31:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可能本是我们的下场\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could have been us.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.11,0:31:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.92,0:31:54.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里可是教堂啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the Lord's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.59,0:31:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.26,0:32:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这仅仅是一个顶盖四面墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just four walls and a roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.11,0:32:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远与我们同在\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll always be with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.63,0:32:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们的一员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.52,0:32:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.19,0:32:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不必\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.66,0:32:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,就抱着她吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let her stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.87,0:32:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她会乖的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust her.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.42,0:32:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就在门外\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm right outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.05,0:32:51.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想对你说声谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to say thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.22,0:32:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.85,0:32:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我到监狱之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the prison,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.22,0:32:59.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直不知道世上还有没有好人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know if there were any good people left.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.69,0:33:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我甚至不知道是否还有人活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't know if anybody was left.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.40,0:33:11.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你加我入伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.60,0:33:15.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你把人们都凝聚起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you took people in.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.08,0:33:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was you, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.30,0:33:28.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我昨天所说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I said yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.67,0:33:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会改口\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't revising it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.81,0:33:36.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算是现在这种世道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even in light of current events.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.06,0:33:41.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,噩梦过后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nightmares end.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.27,0:33:46.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,希望你不会在噩梦中迷失自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}They shouldn't end who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.24,0:33:54.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我这个将死之人想要说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is just this dead man's opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.75,0:34:03.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会记在心里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.04,0:34:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just look at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.13,0:34:14.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就好像这个世界未曾改变\N{\fnArial\fs30}and tell me the world isn't gonna change.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.37,0:34:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要不行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.16,0:34:39.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.87,0:34:41.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.71,0:34:43.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.63,0:34:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么在笑？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you smiling?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.54,0:34:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好像正在做梦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I was dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.90,0:34:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且梦见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.91,0:35:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我灿烂地笑着\N{\fnArial\fs30}were smiling back at me in the dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.45,0:35:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 就像这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.91,0:35:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这算什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.53,0:35:19.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,是因祸得福吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good that comes out of this bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.64,0:35:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.02,0:35:40.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍勃？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bob?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.76,0:36:25.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.86,0:36:42.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在外面等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}You step out.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.50,0:36:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.22,0:37:44.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我们去特区的路线图\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is our route to DC.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.39,0:37:46.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们沿着这个一直走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll stick to it as long as we're able.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.18,0:37:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不行 你们也知道我们在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}If not, well, you got our destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.68,0:37:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要尤金拿到了解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once Eugene gets to the big brains left up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.73,0:37:54.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界就会复原了\N{\fnArial\fs30}things are gonna bounce back.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.52,0:37:57.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,这支队伍应该为此而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}This group should be there for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.86,0:38:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应为此前行\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should be there for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.59,0:38:04.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.10,0:38:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.20,0:38:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我们会\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.29,0:38:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.29,0:39:04.17,Note,0,0,0,0,,（华盛顿特区）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.49,0:39:11.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（对不起 我混球 来华盛顿吧 新的世界需要瑞克 格兰姆斯）
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.35,0:39:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还不知道对于你来说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I never asked how it was for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:54.81,0:39:57.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,终点站意味着什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}getting to Terminus.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.45,0:40:09.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,会杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It killed me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.01,0:40:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 它不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.53,0:40:56.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.55,0:41:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 坐在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, sitting in there…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.43,0:41:14.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,一片寂静\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.73,0:41:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不像昨晚一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't just what happened last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.73,0:41:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,整夜回荡着当时凄惨声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saying what happened before…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.04,0:41:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,震耳响亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}out loud…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.07,0:41:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能回想那个场景\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see it all again.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:41.08,0:41:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那惨叫仿佛就在耳边\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.88,0:41:44.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.50,0:41:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,它不会停止\N{\fnArial\fs30}That won't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.84,0:41:54.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但总不会一直这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it won't be all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.97,0:42:44.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡罗尔去哪了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Carol?
